$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4-Chloro-5-methoxyindan-1-one (12). 5-Methoxyindan-1-one (17.5 kg, 108
mol) was dissolved in AcOH (147 kg) and cooled to +14 °C. Sodium
hypochlorite 10/11% aqueous solution (87 kg, 136 mol) was added such that
the internal temperature was maintained below 17 °C (2.5 h addition
time). After a 20 min age at <10 °C, the batch was cooled to 0-2 °C and
aged for 30 min. Water (50 L) was then added to crystallize the batch.
The batch was filtered, and the cake was washed with 5:1 water/AcOH (18
L) followed by water (2 × 20 L). Drying at 40 °C under a N2 sweep
afforded 15.57 kg of 12 4-Chloro-5-methoxyindan-1-one (12), yield 74% 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.66 (1H, d, J = 8.4 Hz), 7.00 (1H, d, J = 8.4
Hz), 4.00 (3H, s), 3.09 (2H, t, J = 6.0 Hz), 2.71 (2H, d, J = 6.0 Hz);
13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 204.8, 160.0, 154.7, 131.4, 123.3, 119.7,
111.5, 56.7, 36.3, 24.9; mp 130-131 °C; HRMS (ES) calcd for C10H10ClO2
(MH+) 197.0369, found 197.0374.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, scalable
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Development of a Phase Transfer Catalyzed Asymmetric Synthesis for an
Estrogen Receptor Beta Selective Agonist
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Scott, Jeremy P.; Ashwood, Michael S.; Brands, Karel M. J.; Brewer, Sarah
E.; Cowden, Cameron J.; Dolling, Ulf-H.; Emerson, Khateeta M.; Gibb,
Andrew D.; Goodyear, Adrian; Oliver, Steven F.; Stewart, Gavin W.;
Wallace, Debra J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2008), 12(4), 723-730

