Heterocycles
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Maddox, Sean M.; Nalbandian, Christopher J.; Smith, Davis E.; Gustafson,
Jeffrey L.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2015), 17(4), 1042-1045

