$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for the Electrophilic
Aromatic Halogenation; 4-Bromo-2-chloro-1-methoxybenzene (2a-Cl) and
2,4-Dichloro-1-methoxybenzene (2a-diCl; Ref 20): To a solution of
4-bromoanisole (1a; 200.8 mg, 1.09 mmol, 1.0 equiv) in MeCN (2 mL) was
added Nchlorosuccinimide (NCS; 158.3 mg, 1.19 mmol, 1.1 equiv) at r.t. to
give a slightly cloudy mixture. Chlorotrimethylsilane (TMSCl; 14 μL, 0.11
mmol, 0.1 equiv) was then added dropwise to the reaction mixture. Within
a few minutes, the reaction mixture became clear pale yellow solution.
The mixture was stirred continuously at r.t. for 1 h and H2O was added to
it. The separated aqueous layer was extracted with EtOAc. The combined
organic phases were washed with sat. aq NaCl, dried over Na2SO4 and
concentrated. The crude material was purified by flash SiO2 column eluted
with 5-10% EtOAc-hexane.
2-bromo-11-(phenylperoxythio)-6,6a,11,11a-tetrahydro-5H-indolo[3,2-c]quinoline
(2v-p-Br): Yield 64.7 mg (79%, as a white solid).
2,4-dibromo-11-(phenylperoxythio)-6,6a,11,11a-tetrahydro-5H-indolo[3,2-c]quinoline
(2vdiBr): Yield 14.3 mg (15%, as a white solid). (2v-p-Br): mp 244-245
°C; IR (neat): νmax 3403, 2923, 2851, 1496, 1347, 1165 cm-1. 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.90 (d, J = 1.8 Hz, 1H), 7.65-7.60 (m, 3H), 7.56-7.51 (m,
1H), 7.40-7.35 (m, 2H), 7.26-7.22 (m, 1H), 7.14 (td, J = 7.5, 0.6 Hz,
1H), 7.08-7.03 (m, 2H), 6.27 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 1H), 5.38 (d, J = 6.0 Hz,
1H), 3.56 (br s, 1H), 3.50-3.39 (m, 2H), 3.02-3.00 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (75
MHz, CDCl3) δ 144.6, 142.2, 138.4, 134.7, 133.7, 133.1, 131.4, 129.0,
128.3, 127.0, 126.0, 123.1, 122.5, 120.2, 116.8, 110.9, 61.3, 41.2, 40.5.
ESIHRMS calcd for C21H17BrN2NaO2S (Br-79) (M+Na)+ 463.0086, found
463.0066. (2vdiBr): mp 239-240 °C; IR (neat): νmax 3402, 2924, 2853,
1458, 1350, 1167 cm-1. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.89 (d, J = 2.1 Hz,
1H), 7.65-7.60 (m, 3H), 7.54 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.38 (t, J = 7.5 Hz,
2H), 7.29-7.23 (m, 2H), 7.15 (td, J = 7.5, 0.9 Hz, 1H), 7.05 (d, J = 7.5
Hz, 1H), 5.38 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 4.24 (br s, 1H), 3.58 (dt, J = 12.6,
3.0 Hz, 1H), 3.44 (dd, J = 12.6, 3.6 Hz, 1H), 2.99 (app d, J = 8.1 Hz,
1H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 142.03, 141.96, 138.2, 134.3, 133.8,
133.2, 133.1, 129.1, 128.4, 128.3, 127.0, 126.2, 123.3, 120.1, 109.7,
109.5, 61.3, 40.8, 40.3. ESI-HRMS calcd for C21H17Br2N2O2S (Br-79) (M)+•
518.9372, found 518.9364.
